 journey of Taro, Makoto and Masayuki, as they cross between the two worlds, trying to unravel a great mystery. \n\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)\n\n\n\nNote: Anime was made as the 20th anniversary project for Production I.G."],"ja":["神霊狩 Ghost Hound",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-32303":"2021-02-09T10:45:13Z","serial-30259":"2020-12-06T14:42:15Z","serial-22843":"2020-02-16T08:58:37Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-32303","serial-30259","serial-22843"],"relatedMalIds":[],"availableEpisodeCount":22,"rating":7.39}]}